<?svml using="@hypit/markup@1"?>
<svml>
  <import as="media" from="@hypit/media@1"/>
  <import as="text" from="@hypit/text@1"/>
  <import as="gpt" from="@hypit/gpt-image@1"/>
  <import as="seedance" from="@hypit/seedance@1"/>
  <media:Image id="brand-board" src="../../../vi/wearing-round-01/01-cuff.png"/>
  <text:Value id="image-direction">Create a single isolated full-body Wearing character, faithfully derived from the large central character in the supplied brand sheet. Preserve the exact cream softly rounded rectangular head, two small vertical dark oval eyes, no mouth, no ears or hair; small soft mitten hands and broad rounded feet. Preserve the cobalt blue soft matte woven cotton overshirt, oversized folded collar, pale blue rolled cuffs, tiny tonal buttons and two subtle patch pockets. The character stands relaxed, facing the viewer with a tiny natural three-quarter turn, arms comfortably at its sides and feet grounded, quietly alert and charming. Tactile premium 3D animated-film illustration, soft even studio light, fine fabric texture, adult warmth. Entire character is centered in a square with generous white space, height about 76 percent of canvas. Pure uniform white background with only a very faint local contact shadow directly under feet. This is one character asset: no words, logos, UI, badges, furniture, frame, board layout, other poses or additional characters. Preserve the approved design and proportions rather than inventing a new mascot.</text:Value>
  <gpt:Image id="presence" prompt={image-direction} aspect-ratio="1:1" resolution="1K" background="opaque">
    <gpt:Reference image={brand-board}/>
  </gpt:Image>
  <text:Value id="motion-direction">A six-second seamless silent character-animation loop from this exact image. Locked orthographic-feeling camera, unchanged full-body framing, fixed pure white background and soft studio lighting. Preserve the character's cream rounded rectangular head, two black oval eyes with no mouth, mitten hands, cobalt woven overshirt, rolled cuffs, collar, feet, material and proportions. The first second is a calm attentive pose with barely perceptible breathing. It notices the viewer, tilts its head very slightly, slowly lifts one mitten hand for one small friendly wave, gives one soft natural blink, then lowers the hand and returns to exactly the starting pose by the final second. Both feet stay planted; the body remains centered at exactly the same size. Relaxed, thoughtful, subtly playful presence. One continuous uncut shot, no zoom, no camera motion, no walking, no new props, no text, no dramatic squash/stretch, no lip movement, no morphing. The first and last frames should align for a quiet loop. No sound or music.</text:Value>
  <seedance:FrameVideo id="greeting" model="mini" prompt={motion-direction} duration="6" resolution="720p" aspect-ratio="1:1" generate-audio="false" first-frame={presence.image} first-frame-person-reference="false" last-frame={presence.image} last-frame-person-reference="false"/>
</svml>
